  'This study reveals what really happened at the cross. Christ bore the full weight of sin, experienced separation, and voluntarily gave His life. But death could not hold Him.' || E'\n\n' ||
  'When Death Died shows that the resurrection is not just hope—it is proof. Sin was overcome, death was broken, and eternal life is now offered to anyone who trusts in Him.',
  'Beginner',
  'Approx. 55–70 min total',
  7,
