  'Made New in Christ',
  'Many people think Christianity is mainly about trying harder, behaving better, or fixing themselves. But the gospel begins somewhere else.' || E'\n\n' ||
  'Made New in Christ shows that salvation is not earned by right doing. It is received by faith in what Jesus has already accomplished. Through His life, death, resurrection, and ascension, Christ became the new representative head of humanity.' || E'\n\n' ||
  'This study explores how the gospel changes our identity, reconciles us to God, creates a new life within us, and teaches us to live from grace instead of striving for acceptance.',
  'Discover the new life Jesus gives through forgiveness, renewal, and faith.',
  'Many people think Christianity is mainly about trying harder, behaving better, or fixing themselves. But the gospel begins somewhere else.' || E'\n\n' ||
  'Made New in Christ shows that salvation is not earned by right doing. It is received by faith in what Jesus has already accomplished. Through His life, death, resurrection, and ascension, Christ became the new representative head of humanity.' || E'\n\n' ||
  'This study explores how the gospel changes our identity, reconciles us to God, creates a new life within us, and teaches us to live from grace instead of striving for acceptance.',
