  'In Christ, God reconciles us to Himself and begins making every part of life new.',
  8,
  '2 Corinthians 5:14 to 19 · Galatians 2:20 · Colossians 1:13 to 14',
  4,
  null
),
(
  'd3000007-0000-4000-8000-000000000891',
  'e4000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000079',
  'faith-receives-the-facts',
  'Faith Receives the Facts',
  'Faith does not create salvation. Faith receives and rests in the salvation already accomplished in Christ.',
  8,
  'Galatians 2:20 · 2 Timothy 1:8 to 10 · Titus 3:3 to 8',
  5,
  null
),
(
  'd3000007-0000-4000-8000-000000000892',
  'e4000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000079',
  'grace-trains-the-life',
